{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好了～大、大家请回到座位上……”", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 249, "voice": "mc0079", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那么本周的长班会要开始啰！”", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 249, "voice": "mc0080", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "本周的长班会是选在第６节。", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "万智老师进到教室，我跟濑名同学一起站在台前。", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "身为班级干部，我们也担任主持。", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "%51;“跟新吾君站在一起……好～要加油啰万智！”", "text_idx": 5, "plain": "“跟新吾君站在一起……好～要加油啰万智！”", "plain_idx": 244, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 249, "voice": "mc0081", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“今、今天的议题，总之就是考试的事。”", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 249, "voice": "mc0082", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是的。如同大家所知，期中考试快要到了。”", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "ar0265", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊。”", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 249, "voice": "mc0083", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学率先点出了主题。", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在班级干部会的时候我就这么想了，身为搭档，濑名同学的这种地方真的很可靠。", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“下下周的星期二，２７日起连续４天。虽然由于合并试办的缘故，环境跟考试期间也跟着改变了──”", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 46, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "ar0266", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是被选为结女代表的我们，成绩不可以因此而考差。”", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "ar0267", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“绷紧神经，确实地用功念书吧！”", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "ar0268", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "汎用２", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好～”", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "结女学生们", "alt_speaker_idx": 279, "voice": "go031", "char_id": "汎用２"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔，全部都被濑名同学说完了……不，应该说她做得比我更好……唉呼。”", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 249, "voice": "mc0084", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“瓜生君。”", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "ar0269", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊……当然我们各务台的学生也是。为了不要扯班级后腿，认真念书吧！”", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 265, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我也连忙接着说。", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为濑名同学率先发言了，所以我必须好好地收尾。", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……虽然话是这么说，但我一点自信也没有就是了。没问题吧？”", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 265, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "相较于濑名同学始终正经的发言，我则是在最后稍微耍宝了一下。", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "似乎成功缓和了气氛，这让我松了口气。", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊哈哈，总之加油吧，拜托大家了。”", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 265, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊啊，新吾君……我也会加油……！”", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 249, "voice": "mc0085", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我们班的两位班级干部都很可靠，让老师很安心！”", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 249, "voice": "mc0086", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“万智老师也做点事啦～”", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 278, "voice": "sn0057", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“只有老师一个人处在轻松隐居模式呢～”", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 257, "voice": "ag0208", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "ar0270", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "尽管临近期中考试，对我来说依然是把该做的事一件件完成而已。", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“焚烧炉在这里。”", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "ar0271", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "放学后，还是跟濑名同学做班级干部的工作。", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……但我真的没想到，连“代替请假的同学当值日生”这种事也要做就是了。", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "还是说，这是濑名同学主动接下帮忙的吗？", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……怎么了？”", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "ar0272", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊、没有没有……只是和那时相反呢。这次是我让濑名同学带路了。”", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 265, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“在熟悉的地方我不会迷路。那个时候是例外，不要再提了。”", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "ar0273", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“谢谢你带我来，帮了我很大的忙。”", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 265, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "总之微笑，然后向她道谢。", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然我大概掌握校内环境了，不过还没去过焚烧炉，所以才请她带路。", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……这也是工作。”", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "ar0274", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学移开视线，语气冷漠地说。", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊哈哈。”", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 265, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“无缘无故就笑的人，我不喜欢。”", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "ar0275", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“已经知道地点了吧，我先回去了。我还有其他工作。”", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "ar0276", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她带着不悦的表情快步离开了。", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……哎呀哎呀。”", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 265, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我耸了耸肩膀。", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "好，赶快丢完垃圾回去找濑名同学吧……", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "结束打扫后，接着是整理资料的工作。", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我和濑名同学待在没有其他人的教室里，面对面坐着埋头工作。", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不管完成多少，工作都不会减少呢……”", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 265, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为我们班是以至今为止都没有的形式运作的班级，刚起步这也是没办法的。”", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "ar0277", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一边回答，濑名同学的手也没有停下。", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不对，应该说她回答的时候又更加速工作了。", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "笔尖沙沙沙地不停滑动，当我注意到时她已经完成比我多好几倍的量了。", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不过到期中考前应该就会告一段落了。给学生增加这么多负担就本末倒置了。”", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "ar0278", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊啊……所以这星期就撑一下的感觉？”", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 265, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "的确，对学校来说，应该会让考试前的学生专心念书才对。", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……不然会让人很困扰的。”", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "ar0279", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学最后小声地这么回答后就不再开口，我也跟着沉默。", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“结束了。”", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "ar0280", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“瓜生君还没好吧。那不好意思我先走了。”", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "ar0281", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后，比我提早许多做完工作的濑名同学，就像往常一样先回家了。", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……哎呀哎呀。”", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 265, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
